# Venus × Minerva license dispatcher

This repository is the current public distribution boundary for project-owned material in this tree. Historical distributions retain any rights actually granted with those distributions.

- Project-owned theory, Canon, documentation, knowledge, reconstruction records, and manuscript source are offered under **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 International**.
- Project-owned software and executable tooling are offered under **PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0**.
- Commercial permissions require a separate written grant from the rightsholder.
- Third-party material, quotations, bibliographic metadata, and license texts remain subject to their own rights/status.

Exact scope and official-license references are in `licenses/`.
